      "name": "@openviking/dsh-openviking-settings",
      "title": {
        "en": "OpenViking Status",
        "zh": "OpenViking 状态"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Adds an OpenViking status page to the DSH Settings dialog: connection, service health, memory and session counts, capture settings and a redacted server configuration. Requires a deployed OpenViking service — the page only shows live data after OpenViking is running and configured.",
        "zh": "在 DSH【设置】里新增 OpenViking 状态页：连接状态、服务健康、记忆与会话计数、捕获开关以及脱敏的服务端配置。需要先部署 OpenViking 服务，配置完成后页面才会显示实时数据。"
      },
